    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n39552" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπικάλυμμα</span></b>  [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κᾰ], <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ατος</span>, τό</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>cover,
